kind: finding
is: On the old body's evidence the claim that a numeric space is the root of all natural languages rests on one result: a content-interned node is where two surface strings meet when a hand-made table maps both to one label, for one fixed sentence shape. The sentence category is numeric; the two things the sentence is about are strings.
