n: 3.10.3
name: neighbours
kind: hub
is: Beside the translator stand six other schemes that each give a meaning an id by a different rule: 64 English words defined over themselves (104 with extensions), a 36-symbol codebook, four phrase meanings in 13 locales, a 10,000-row label table that is 57.0% machine translation with 0 rows reviewed, alias rows over decimal ids, and a dictionary of numeric meaning recipes with 28 English mappings. Only the dictionary derives a meaning's identity from content; one crossing cell relates three of the schemes, for three anchors.
at: 2026-11-24

