kind: finding
is: A word is an entry of a lens and not part of the node: a surface node (language, text) and a mapping (surface, context, concept, provenance), with many surfaces per concept and many concepts per surface. The model is the old dictionary of numeric meaning recipes, not the translator's rows with one column per language.
status: inferred
conf: high
